[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5401.35, "timestamp": "01:30:01", "text": "好的。好的。所以，我们正在这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5403.03, "timestamp": "01:30:03", "text": "生存模式中的奥秘。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5404.149, "timestamp": "01:30:04", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5407.189, "timestamp": "01:30:07", "text": "好的。点击。好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5409.11, "timestamp": "01:30:09", "text": "好了。好的。这是你的起点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5411.91, "timestamp": "01:30:11", "text": "设备。呃，L，你只想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5415.11, "timestamp": "01:30:15", "text": "比如使用这个默认的，或者做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5417.75, "timestamp": "01:30:17", "text": "你只想获得黄金然后购买"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5420.87, "timestamp": "01:30:20", "text": "自己做？呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5422.55, "timestamp": "01:30:22", "text": "因为如果你想那样做，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5424.47, "timestamp": "01:30:24", "text": "我会向你解释如何做到这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5426.629, "timestamp": "01:30:26", "text": "但如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5428.79, "timestamp": "01:30:28", "text": "你不知道，因为那里有家商店。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5430.07, "timestamp": "01:30:30", "text": "它里面有很多东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5433.03, "timestamp": "01:30:33", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5435.669, "timestamp": "01:30:35", "text": "多少钱？我没钱了，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5437.189, "timestamp": "01:30:37", "text": "嗯，是的，目前你只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5438.95, "timestamp": "01:30:38", "text": "你可以选择全部接受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5440.79, "timestamp": "01:30:40", "text": "这东西盖住了这里的一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5443.91, "timestamp": "01:30:43", "text": "还有九块钱。是的，这是为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5446.229, "timestamp": "01:30:46", "text": "自由的。或者你也可以只取50个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5448.79, "timestamp": "01:30:48", "text": "钱。这取决于你对哪一种感觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5453.62, "timestamp": "01:30:53", "text": "点赞会更好。你怎么认为？"